Being completely honest and serious for a moment... your idea was my
favorite gejyspa.  I'm not sure why people didn't take it seriously.  I
think one of the complaints was "but it's still starting the cycles at a
constant spot so it might not be acceptable for some cultures" to which
I say "well, it has to start somewhere and yes, sometimes learning a
foreign language is difficult".

=20

